Inventory loss is different from taking damage yourself (except in the
case of disintegration IIUC).  For example, (non-exclusive list to
follow) if you step on a fire trap you can lose flammable materials
whether you are resistant or not; the same goes for bolts of lightning
and rings or wands, and cold blasts and potions .  Disintegration (and
I suppose death rays deserve mention too) is different in that having
the resistance also protects your stuff.  AFAIK!



